{"2428730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SWAT Commander: Prologue", "steam_appid": 2428730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SWAT Commander: Prologue</i> is the FREE introductory version of our team tactical shooter and does not reflect the final version of the game. Check out its full version's page for a description of its features!</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue, you face the challenges of our second mission – Hot Reception. <strong>Team up</strong> with your friends in a SWAT squad or go in <strong>solo</strong> to investigate an auto shop where a violent shootout between rival gangs took place. Secure any evidence of criminal activity, bring the perpetrators to justice, and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/5f7b7edb74843a78e4460d8ee9983243.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself familiar with the <strong>mission's briefing</strong> and find out what dangers emerged to threaten innocent civilians – you're about to face them yourself. Equip your SWAT operative accordingly with a selection of rifles, handguns, armors, and tactical gear to tackle the belligerent gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/88329a05ccfe0a9431432d2f56dc4cf7.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a multiplayer lobby to <strong>invite other players</strong> or <strong>go into the mission solo or</strong> <strong>join the lobby of another SWAT commander</strong>. Coordinate and discuss your mission plan down to the equipment each of you will be bringing or the entry point you'll be choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/f87d3b4a1defdd60dfc2d83bace7e60c.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of the <strong>three available game modes</strong> to determine the type of mission you'll be embarking on – <strong>high-risk warrant</strong>, <strong>barricaded suspect</strong>, and <strong>bomb threat</strong>. Your operations' goals can change between bringing down dangerous suspects, neutralizing entrenched criminals, and defusing an explosive device. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/3af633f93d7a9988ed1be582192fa3de.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Bernard Tire &amp; Auto Center</strong> to begin the SWAT intervention. Secure your mission objectives and earn an evaluation of your performance. Remember to keep your eyes open and use every tactical advantage you can think of. Defend the innocents and bring the perps to justice!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SWAT Commander: Prologue</i> is the FREE introductory version of our team tactical shooter and does not reflect the final version of the game. Check out its full version's page for a description of its features!</strong>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the prologue, you face the challenges of our second mission – Hot Reception. <strong>Team up</strong> with your friends in a SWAT squad or go in <strong>solo</strong> to investigate an auto shop where a violent shootout between rival gangs took place. Secure any evidence of criminal activity, bring the perpetrators to justice, and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/5f7b7edb74843a78e4460d8ee9983243.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/9e90b287f34eca31c3a25a1d49f4bab5.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself familiar with the <strong>mission's briefing</strong> and find out what dangers emerged to threaten innocent civilians – you're about to face them yourself. Equip your SWAT operative accordingly with a selection of rifles, handguns, armors, and tactical gear to tackle the belligerent gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/88329a05ccfe0a9431432d2f56dc4cf7.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/0cf8fe369ca505452624caea534488f0.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a multiplayer lobby to <strong>invite other players</strong> or <strong>go into the mission solo or</strong> <strong>join the lobby of another SWAT commander</strong>. Coordinate and discuss your mission plan down to the equipment each of you will be bringing or the entry point you'll be choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/f87d3b4a1defdd60dfc2d83bace7e60c.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/24faa91508283749db123507740987bf.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of the <strong>three available game modes</strong> to determine the type of mission you'll be embarking on – <strong>high-risk warrant</strong>, <strong>barricaded suspect</strong>, and <strong>bomb threat</strong>. Your operations' goals can change between bringing down dangerous suspects, neutralizing entrenched criminals, and defusing an explosive device. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/3af633f93d7a9988ed1be582192fa3de.webp?t=1787741922\" width=471 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.poster.avif?t=1787741922\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.webm?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/extras/03969f21c5654e19858c3838376ddc88.mp4?t=1787741922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Bernard Tire &amp; Auto Center</strong> to begin the SWAT intervention. Secure your mission objectives and earn an evaluation of your performance. Remember to keep your eyes open and use every tactical advantage you can think of. Defend the innocents and bring the perps to justice!</p>", "short_description": "The FREE PROLOGUE version of our tactical squad shooter. In SWAT Commander: Prologue, you join an elite special forces unit. Team up with other operatives, manage your equipment, and most importantly – complete your mission successfully.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Polish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Slovak<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/de1ea098a1a7ef44184404ae5eb7ed61016cb703/header.jpg?t=1787741922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/6c8bd095ce358987715605da8009945e4f88e18c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787741922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428730/6c8bd095ce358987715605da8009945e4f88e18c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787741922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-12100F or AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050M 4GB or GTX 1650 4GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p / 30 FPS ・ Upscaler disabled</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F or AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600XT 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p / 60 FPS ・ Upscaler dis